      "speaker_hint": null,
      "speaker_hint_basis": "unresolved",
      "EN": "I haven't heard much. All I know is that their boss Borov has some type of key around his neck that fits to the underground door there. Supposed to lead into some type of lab, or something... I did hear that Borov has been eager to get inside, but can't without the second half of the key. Now, if you're thinking of trying to get inside that compound, think twice before you do. It's full of thugs.",
